# Module FullSidebar - en_US
# WARNING: a % inside a value makes Translate::transnoentitiesnoconv() run sprintf().
# Only use %s on keys actually called with an argument.

ModuleFullSidebarName=Full sidebar menu
ModuleFullSidebarDesc=Left menu showing every module and its submenus
FullSidebarDescription=Left menu showing every module and its submenus
FullSidebarDescriptionLong=Replaces the contextual left menu of Dolibarr with a collapsible tree listing every module and all of their submenus, reachable from any page. The top menu, the mobile menu and the theme are left untouched.

FullSidebarSetup=Full sidebar setup
FullSidebarNavLabel=Full navigation

FullSidebarEnabled=Enable the full sidebar
FullSidebarEnabledHelp=Sets the MAIN_MENU_STANDARD constant. Menu handler currently active: %s
FullSidebarHideTopMenu=Hide the entries of the top menu
FullSidebarHideTopMenuHelp=The top bar stays, with the logo, the search box, the user block and the hamburger button (needed to open the sidebar on a phone): only the module entries, redundant with the sidebar, are hidden.
FullSidebarExpandAll=Expand everything by default
FullSidebarExpandAllHelp=When no, only the current module and the path leading to the displayed page are expanded on load.
FullSidebarRememberOpened=Remember opened branches
FullSidebarRememberOpenedHelp=Keeps the branches each user expanded in their own browser.
FullSidebarShowUnauthorized=Show unauthorized entries
FullSidebarShowUnauthorizedHelp=Show entries the user has no permission on, greyed out, instead of hiding them.

FullSidebarSidebarTitle=Sidebar
FullSidebarTopBarTitle=Top bar
FullSidebarTopBarIntro=Native Dolibarr options (Home - Setup - Display), mirrored here: hiding the top menu entries frees that bar, and these tools fill it. They remain core constants, shared with the rest of Dolibarr.
FullSidebarTopSearch=Global search in the top bar
FullSidebarTopSearchHelp=Recommended with the full sidebar: the search form is then no longer placed at the top of the sidebar, where it competes with the module tree.
FullSidebarTopQuickAdd=Quick add button
FullSidebarTopQuickAddHelp=Adds a "+" button opening a quick creation menu (third party, proposal, invoice, ...).
FullSidebarTopImportFile=Upload file link
FullSidebarTopImportFileHelp=Adds a file upload icon. This option has no setup screen in Dolibarr.
FullSidebarTopImportFileCustom=A custom url is stored and will be kept: %s

FullSidebarWarnNotRegistered=The menu handler of the module is not registered in the configuration. Module parts (menus, CSS, JS) are read AT ACTIVATION TIME: disable then enable the FullSidebar module in Setup - Modules.
FullSidebarSetupNote=The menu handler ships with the module itself: no Dolibarr core file is modified. If the module is disabled, Dolibarr automatically falls back to the previous menu.
FullSidebarBreadcrumb=Breadcrumb
